  "body": "## Wallpaper Reactor 0.31.0\n\n_Changes since 0.30.0_\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Nine new languages: Japanese, German, French, Korean, Indonesian, Turkish, Polish, Italian and Vietnamese\n- Large wallpapers and settings sync are now free when you are signed in, and Pro is now private wallpapers and supporting the app\n\n## Features\n\n### All platforms\n\n- Wallpapers mute themselves while another app plays sound\n- Sign in from another device with a code, and see those devices in Settings, Account, each with Sign out\n- Wallpapers your version cannot run are hidden, and a direct link to one says it needs a newer version of the app\n- Changing an option in a preview applies right away instead of reloading the preview\n- Shader previews play their animation from the start\n- Wallpaper details tell you when a wallpaper needs a newer version of the app\n- Settings options describe themselves, so the help and info icons are gone\n- Option menus open with the same motion as the rest of the app\n\n### Windows\n\n- Animate a picture with your own AI coding agent, which connects to the app through a private, token-protected agent server\n- The notification-area menu shows icons\n\n### macOS\n\n- Animate a picture with your own AI coding agent, which connects to the app through a private, token-protected agent server\n- A menu bar item with Open, Reload and Close\n- The paywall says when prices are unavailable or when you need to sign in\n\n### Linux\n\n- Animate a picture with your own AI coding agent, which connects to the app through a private, token-protected agent server\n- The tray menu shows icons\n\n## Fixes\n\n### All platforms\n\n- Fixed the Licenses screen running past the edge of a phone screen\n- Fixed long tab labels being cut off\n\n### Android\n\n- Fixed a crash report and restart when Android reclaimed the app's web view, which now rebuilds in place and returns you to your screen\n- Fixed an old frame showing for a moment when the wallpaper resumed\n- Fixed unmuting a wallpaper restarting it while another app was playing sound\n\n### Windows\n\n- Fixed the pointer freezing for a moment when a wallpaper reloaded\n- Fixed the wallpaper staying paused after the windows covering it were closed\n\n### Linux\n\n- Fixed a black wallpaper on some setups\n- Fixed signing in from the browser not returning to the app\n\n## Downloads\n\n| Platform | Get it |\n| --- | --- |\n| Android | [Google Play](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.wallpaperreactor) · [APK](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-android.apk) |\n| Windows | [Microsoft Store](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N4302CRDQRL) · [Installer (.exe)](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-windows-x64-setup.exe) · [.msi](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-windows-x64.msi) |\n| macOS | [Mac App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wallpaper-reactor-lite/id6751447022) · [.dmg](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-macos-universal.dmg) |\n| Linux (KDE Plasma, GNOME, Sway, Hyprland) | [.deb](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-linux-amd64.deb) · [Flatpak](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.31.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.31.0-linux-amd64.flatpak) |\n\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor/compare/v0.30.0...v0.31.0\n"
